{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find, grab, and process object. Approach if necessary. Take photo, move to new position.     list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToPoint    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakePhoto    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewPosition    />",
